Modifications by fak contributors: translated the search contracts to Go over
RuntimeTopology and existing fitplan workload/SLO/calibration receipts; added
per-rank peak-memory and reservation checks, strict observation matching,
deterministic ordering and pins, incumbent retention, explicit unknown reasons,
bounded command input and CPU-only owned fixtures. Measurements are supplied
inputs, not independently verified hardware qualifications. Link changes require
matching measurements; missing curves are never filled with guessed rates.

